1
00:00:00,663 --> 00:00:02,873
(Penny:)What's up with Ichabod?

2
00:00:03,666 --> 00:00:05,376
(Leonard:)Oh, he's trying to make a new friend.

3
00:00:05,542 --> 00:00:07,332
(Penny:)Oh, really? Well, good for him.

4
00:00:07,503 --> 00:00:09,713
Unless he makes one out of wood
like Geppetto...

5
00:00:09,880 --> 00:00:11,590
(Leonard:)...I don't think it's gonna happen.

6
00:00:13,175 --> 00:00:15,055
(Penny:)Well, how did you guys become friends?

7
00:00:15,219 --> 00:00:18,219
There was a flyer on the bulletin board
at the university:

8
00:00:18,389 --> 00:00:22,179
"Roommate wanted.
Whistlers need not apply."

9
00:00:22,685 --> 00:00:23,855
(Penny:)And you moved in anyway?

10
00:00:24,019 --> 00:00:25,689
(Leonard:)I assumed he was joking.

11
00:00:25,854 --> 00:00:30,234
(Leonard:)You'd be surprised how many
particle physicists have a whimsical side.

12
00:00:30,401 --> 00:00:33,441
What about Howard and Raj?
How did he become friends with them?

13
00:00:33,612 --> 00:00:36,452
(Leonard:)I don't know. How do carbon atoms
form a benzene ring?

14
00:00:36,615 --> 00:00:38,865
(Leonard:)Proximity and valence electrons.

15
00:00:40,327 --> 00:00:43,037
(Penny:)Well, yeah, sure,
when you put it that way.

16
00:00:43,580 --> 00:00:45,580
(Penny:)But it all worked out, right?

17
00:00:45,749 --> 00:00:46,879
(Leonard:)I suppose.

18
00:00:47,042 --> 00:00:49,082
(Leonard:)I do miss whistling though.

19
00:00:49,253 --> 00:00:50,543
(Penny:)Oh, come on. Really?

20
00:00:52,006 --> 00:00:53,586
(Sheldon:)First warning.

21
00:00:57,386 --> 00:00:58,426
(Scene:)Penny.

22
00:00:58,595 --> 00:01:01,025
(Sheldon:)Penny. Penny.

